%e A086776 6047 is a term because it is the smaller member of the prime pair (6047, 6053) and 6047 + 6053 = 12100 = 110^2.
%p A086776 f:= n-> (p-> `if`(andmap(isprime, [p, p+6]), p, [][]))(2*n^2-3):
